    ('prAtomicHint', 'zh-CN', '规则参数只取当前规则类型用得上的那一格：成本乘倍数填 multiplier，成本加价与统一售价填 amount，目标毛利率填 margin（0.3 表示 30%）。筛选集范围必须指定工程（页面顶部切换），空筛选不会全表改价；单批命中商品数有上限，超过请收紧条件。任何变体缺少成本价或算价越界时，整批应用都会被拒绝；请先在预览中查看并修正这些条目。', 200, 'admin', 'product atomic writes', 1, now(), now()),
    ('prAtomicHint', 'en-US', 'Only the field used by the selected rule is read: multiplier for cost multiplied by a factor, amount for cost plus markup or a fixed price, and margin for target gross margin (0.3 means 30%). Filter scope requires a project and at least one condition. Narrow the filters if the batch exceeds the product limit. If any variant lacks a required cost or produces an out-of-range price, the entire application is rejected. Review and fix those items in the preview first.', 200, 'admin', 'product atomic writes', 1, now(), now()),
