    ('pHintAttrs', 'zh-CN', '商品属性页定义属性组，同一个属性组可以被多个商品引用；商品分类与商品品牌页定义分类和品牌，商品可以挂多个分类（其中一个为主分类）并指定品牌；商品标签页定义标签，手工标签可手动挂载，自动标签按内置规则自动维护归属。', '0', 'product', '商品界面完整句', '1', now(), now()),
    ('pHintAttrs', 'en-US', 'Attribute groups are defined on the product attributes page and can be shared by many products. Categories and brands are defined on their own pages; a product can have several categories (one marked primary) and one brand. Tags are defined on the product tags page; manual tags are attached by hand and rule tags keep their membership automatically.', '0', 'product', '商品界面完整句', '1', now(), now()),
    ('pHintVariants', 'zh-CN', '变体与评分属于单个商品，在商品的编辑页维护（点行的「编辑」进入）。评分是独立明细：平均值与条数由明细算出，改评分不改动商品字段；「没有评分」与「评分 0 分」是两回事。', '0', 'product', '商品界面完整句', '1', now(), now()),
    ('pHintVariants', 'en-US', 'Variants and ratings belong to a single product and are maintained on the product edit page (open it from the row). Ratings are a separate ledger: the average and count are computed from the entries, and editing a rating never changes product fields. "No ratings" and "a rating of 0" are different states.', '0', 'product', '商品界面完整句', '1', now(), now()),
    ('pHintEdit', 'zh-CN', '多语言与商品基本字段在编辑页里改；「预览」按当前详情页模板渲染前台效果。', '0', 'product', '商品界面完整句', '1', now(), now()),
    ('pHintEdit', 'en-US', 'Translations and the basic product fields are edited on the edit page; "Preview" renders the storefront with the current detail template.', '0', 'product', '商品界面完整句', '1', now(), now()),
    ('pPriceHint', 'zh-CN', '想先看每个 SKU 的「原价 → 新价」，去定价工具页试算（不落库）。', '0', 'product', '商品界面完整句', '1', now(), now()),
